{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_03_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e17c8c924b4c6899c1ab8bbdde4cd84fcf8a4d3773006a672496946ef68fea68",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa01898a2146aab8856566a71ff6fa3b2459143bde0079b352a97419ebd844e4",
      "text": "希望的VICTORY",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b41f108edf7469451896b141d3a408bc500d14a19d4cf55b05d531fb7b2e9706",
      "text": "为了在男极‘速度部门’中战斗，\nW出战了偶像大运动会。一路领先\n领跑的两人，却因一个小失误\n引发了争执。进而享介还察觉到了\n他们犯下的更严重的失误……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000016:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000016:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa01898a2146aab8856566a71ff6fa3b2459143bde0079b352a97419ebd844e4",
      "text": "希望的VICTORY",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:611d65eabf4a7e83ea4e559cf66e7abd19250c0c4f8814a6867211be98510331",
      "text": "偶像大运动会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4872da6ef2ec1b258c3e950c4a56ff19c61627784b1211a2e6aaef8be7d86cf4",
      "text": "“宣誓！我们作为偶像，无论发生什么，\n都一定会迅速抵达舞台！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ebd28e21108e8137297b532fa8088b37f74ce182d87c7e650b2527d90603994",
      "text": "“我们发誓，所有参赛者都将以第一名为目标，\n堂堂正正地展开竞赛！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:315b4a1a12037300294954d86f146dd101ec38b08b06e0a9892f25847766af7d",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么《偶像大运动会》现在正式开幕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000071:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:072245937730980a3afa64e9d9a6bffdf4b61b17c15cb55d9b074352985e1d67",
      "text": "开幕式后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d00d9317af9d7acb2aa37d290aebe51c320704df182d0e77f3f1d9a9fff44ed",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n我们的选手宣誓感觉挺不错的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25aa539310baf9e230104d9254bc9871c1e553317ae48fb03ac92ed51f4c2f6",
      "text": "堂堂正正的，非常帅气哦！赶来应援的\n神速一魂两个人也是这么说的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccd4d3a18480abb1a58ce950a746a48da3de8cef320f04a91d6f47b03e4a08bf",
      "text": "嘿嘿，再多夸夸我也行哦♪\n不过在正赛里，我们会展现出更棒的一面的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83e3866aebbb2b2e5fdcd0d004fad45f4ef52ac8fda331573376c766807df39c",
      "text": "共同参赛的人里，好像有很多对运动能力很有自信的\n肌肉猛男硬汉偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30fa5be1769f460da90db8c63a5e922c5a9af126746cafd2576facea0b7d18d0",
      "text": "但能赢过曾是足球选手的我们这种事，\n可没有哪个偶像做得到！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6893f30b7ef4f4461e94b7fbe026c2e97c7fb19f85c2d8e68974d8424dab47",
      "text": "让他们见识一下，\n曾在球场上纵横驰骋的我们的力量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42cd5658beae1c5f7ef55d9a8e973439e603f1e84851ea7d261d705f722909fa",
      "text": "没错！所以说，●●●●●●●●●●监督。\n优胜就交给W吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
